<center><font class="option" color="#000000"><b>Announcement on the SPOILERS</b></font></center><br>
<font class="content"><div align=justify>Due to <STRONG>a little</STRONG> adverse criticism we received for posting some info about <STRONG>Madonna's upcoming tour, not already spoiled,</STRONG> we decided to publish the next news <STRONG>from tour rehearsals</STRONG>, <STRONG>in the <A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums&file=viewforum&f=25" target=_blank>Re-Invention Lounge</A> section of our Message Board <A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank>MadonnaVillage.it</A>.</STRONG><BR><BR><STRONG>Sorry but you need to register to access our forums, even if you are a Drowned Madonna member.</STRONG><BR><BR>After registered you will receive the confirmation e-mail with your password. <STRONG>If don't please contact us. Then login through the box on the left of each page of </STRONG><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank><STRONG>Madonna Village.it</STRONG></A>.<BR><BR><STRONG>The Drowned Madonna Team</STRONG></div></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<br><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3"><tr><td>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="8" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><tr><td>
<center><font class="option" color="#000000"><b>The French Lounge + The Brazilian & Portuguese Lounge</b></font></center><br>
<font class="content"><P><STRONG>Drowned Madonna</STRONG> has received many request concerning a <STRONG>French Section</STRONG> and a <b>Brazilian and Portuguese Section</b> of our Forums at <STRONG><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank>MadonnaVillage.it</A></STRONG>. </P>
<P>So, we decided to launch <STRONG>The French Lounge</STRONG> and <b>The Brazilian & Portuguese Lounge</b> as an experiment. We are looking for moderators for these forum sections. Submit your candidatures - <STRONG><A href="mailto:giampiero@drownedmadonna.com">click here</A></STRONG> - or just write on <STRONG>The French Lounge</STRONG> and on the <b>The Brazilian & Portuguese Lounge</b>... and attract attention!</P>
<P><STRONG>We invite all our French, Brazilian and Portuguese readers to join it!</STRONG></P>
<P>Finally, we remind you that we have <STRONG>German</STRONG>, <b>Spanish</b> and <STRONG>Polish</STRONG> Forum Sections too.</P>
<P><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums" target=_blank><STRONG>Click here to enter our Forums>></STRONG></A></P></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<br><table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td align="left">
<font class="storytitle" color="#FFFFFF"><b>Glam As You - Saturday 26th June @ Club Med World - PARIS</b></font>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=9"><img src="images/topics/party.gif" border="0" Alt="Parties" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">The <STRONG>Glam As You</STRONG> is the&nbsp;one and only Parisian gay/gay friendly&nbsp;"soirée" to propose a unique musical programme (featuring all the current gay icons) remixed by the biggest DJ's + a live performance of a very famous artist.&nbsp; 
<P><IMG src="http://www.g-a-y-france.com/images/logo_fleur.jpg" border=0><BR><BR>The <STRONG>Glam As You</STRONG>&nbsp;is organizing so many special events in Paris&nbsp;for the day of the Gay Pride parade for all <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s fans. </P>
<P><STRONG>21h30 / 00h - Warm-up Madonna special</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>On the occasion of the Gay Pride parade, the Club Med World has organized a coreography show dedicated to the artist...</STRONG>&nbsp;&nbsp; </P>
<P>00H / 06H - Glam&nbsp;As You</P>
<P>DJ line-up: Guéna LG &amp; Esteban - pop Programme, dance, vocal house + "Icons Battle: Beyonce Vs.&nbsp; J's it",</P>
<P><STRONG>1h15: Fashion show.&nbsp; The&nbsp;show will focus on&nbsp;4&nbsp; pictures inspired to the Like&nbsp;A Virgin, Vogue, Erotica and American Life eras.&nbsp;16&nbsp;Madonna's songs!</STRONG>&nbsp; </P>
<P>2h30: On the scene of the Glam&nbsp;As You:</P>
<P>- Nicolas.O (former WhatFor) will&nbsp;premiere his first solo single "Look for The Boy", Taxi tube Girl (<STRONG>Mirwais</STRONG>)</P>
<P>- Benassi Bros.&nbsp; Feat.&nbsp; Dhany!&nbsp; <STRONG>The Benassi Bros have just finished an American Life&nbsp;remix.</STRONG>&nbsp; Dhany will&nbsp;play&nbsp;it exclusively for the Glam&nbsp;As You soriéer.&nbsp; </P>
<P>- Gaysthouse.com will celebrate its first 3 years and offers as a price a trip from Paris to Barcelona for 2 persons, <STRONG>2&nbsp;tickets for the concert of Madonna&nbsp;at Bercy</STRONG>...&nbsp; </P>
<P>Admission fee&nbsp;+ drink: 15€ in&nbsp;pre-sale (or 20€)</P>
<P>Bottle + table in the VIP area&nbsp;(max. 5 pers.) in&nbsp;pre-sale = 130€&nbsp; (Including 5&nbsp;tickets for the soriéer).&nbsp; </P>
<P>Pre-sale at:</P>
<P>- Lucky Records, 66 rue de la Verrerie 75004 Paris et <BR>- Ecoute Ce Disque, 12 rue Simon Lefranc 75004 Paris <BR><BR>Club Med World - 39 Cour St Emilion - 75012 Paris - Métro Cour St Emilion (ligne 14 météor) </P>
<P>More info on <A href="http://www.glamasyou.com" target=_blank><STRONG>www.glamasyou.com</STRONG></A> <BR><BR>Special thanks to our reader <STRONG>Hugo</STRONG> for bringing this to our attention. </P>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


