<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td align="left">
<font class="storytitle" color="#FFFFFF"><b>How does a venue hosting Madonna prepare? - PART II</b></font>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">As he promised, <STRONG>The Director of Marketing Worcester's Centrum Centre / SMG</STRONG>, <STRONG>John LaHair</STRONG>, has contacted us again, sending the following info and pic (click it to enlarge it):<BR><BR><STRONG>Worcester's Centrum Centre/SMG</STRONG> in <STRONG>Worcester</STRONG>, <STRONG>MA</STRONG> has a new look for the next few weeks as the ENTIRE city gears up for <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s ONLY <STRONG>New England</STRONG> shows. The installation of the window graphics on the front side of the facility was completed a week and ½ ago, but rather than keep it "hush-hush" for the fans attending the shows, we've decided to share it with you now! All the local clubs &amp; restaurants in <STRONG>Downtown Worcester</STRONG> are gearing up for 4 nights with special themed events AND the venue will be transforming an area in our attached <STRONG>Convention Center</STRONG> to the <STRONG>LUCKY STAR CAFE &amp; CLUB</STRONG>. Info on a special all inclusive pre-event dinner will be made available very shortly. Don't have tickets yet??? What are you waiting for? Great seats have been released for all shows. Get them now while they last at <STRONG><A href="http://www.ticketmaster.com" target=_blank>ticketmaster.com</A></STRONG>. <BR><BR><A href="re/Worcester_Centrum.jpg" target=_blank><IMG src="/re/Worcester_Centrum_small.jpg" border=0></A>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


