<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">The president of Brazilian <STRONG>Madonna Unconditional Fan Club</STRONG> and website <STRONG><A href="http://www.madomaniac.com" target=_blank>Madomaniac.com</A></STRONG>, <STRONG>Rodrigo</STRONG>, has contacted us to annunce that the <STRONG>"Madweek 2004"</STRONG> - the biggest event for <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> in the world - <STRONG>will take place in Brazil from July 16 to Jule 24</STRONG>. <BR><BR>Stay tuned for more details.
