<font class="content">Written by <a href="">gugarko</a> on Thursday, June 17 @  W. Europe Daylight Time  [10 reads].</font><br>
<font class="content"">(<a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=3151">comments?</a> | <a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=categories&amp;op=newindex&amp;catid=10">BREAKING NEWS</a> | Score: 0)</font>

